he living grant"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","3",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Duration"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Regular master's duration: three or four semesters"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Check your chosen programme"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","4",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Academic record"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Top 10% of the bachelor's programme; self-assessment"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Explain the result with academic context"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Source: ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://ethz.ch/students/en/studies/financial/scholarships/excellencescholarship.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"ETH official ESOP programme"}]]}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]]}]
24:["$","figure",null,{"className":"page-visual page-visual--inline","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/images/design/es/research-1280.webp","srcSet":"/images/design/es/research-640.webp 640w, /images/design/es/research-1280.webp 1280w","sizes":"(max-width: 860px) calc(100vw - 32px), 440px","width":1280,"height":853,"alt":"Two students discussing charts on a laptop in an illustrative academic workspace","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"children":"Illustrative research scene; not a photograph of the named university or scholarship recipients."}]]}]
25:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[null,["$","section","1-Who is eligible, and which application counts?",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Who is eligible, and which application counts?"}],[["$","p","Apply through the master's eApply route during its first application window. Applicants already enrolled in an ETH master's or holding a master's degree are not eligible for ESOP. Admission to an eligible degree and award of the scholarship remain separate decisions.",{"children":"Apply through the master's eApply route during its first application window. Applicants already enrolled in an ETH master's or holding a master's degree are not eligible for ESOP. Admission to an eligible degree and award of the scholarship remain separate decisions."}],["$","p","Check the degree programme's language, academic prerequisites and application documents before preparing the scholarship extras. Do not interpret top 10% as a promise of selection or convert your GPA with an arbitrary online formula. Use the grading scale and any reliable cohort context your university can provide.",{"children":"Check the degree programme's language, academic prerequisites and application documents before preparing the scholarship extras. Do not interpret top 10% as a promise of selection or convert your GPA with an arbitrary online formula. Use the grading scale and any reliable cohort context your university can provide."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://ethz.ch/students/en/studies/financial/scholarships/excellencescholarship.html",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://ethz.ch/students/en/studies/financial/scholarships/excellencescholarship.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"ETH ESOP eligibility and first-window rule"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}],["$","section","2-Write your own ESOP thesis pre-proposal",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Write your own ESOP thesis pre-proposal"}],[["$","p","ETH's linked guidance sets a maximum of 500 words excluding references for the pre-proposal. It asks for a possible research project with a question, context, method and realistic milestones. The final thesis topic is developed later during the degree; the application is an opportunity to show how you think about research.",{"children":"ETH's linked guidance sets a maximum of 500 words excluding references for the pre-proposal. It asks for a possible research project with a question, context, method and realistic milestones. The final thesis topic is developed later during the degree; the application is an opportunity to show how you think about research."}],["$","p","Choose a topic you can defend. Read and cite the work you rely on, distinguish an existing result from your proposed contribution and describe what would make the project feasible. ETH explicitly requires independent authorship and established citation practice. Use feedback to improve clarity without outsourcing the intellectual work.",{"children":"Choose a topic you can defend. Read and cite the work you rely on, distinguish an existing result from your proposed contribution and describe what would make the project feasible. ETH explicitly requires independent authorship and established citation practice. Use feedback to improve clarity without outsourcing the intellectual work."}]],"$undefined","$L29","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$L2a","$undefined"]}],"$L2b","$L2c","$L2d","$L2e"]}]
