2b:["$","section","3-Reference invitations and submission sequence",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Reference invitations and submission sequence"}],[["$","p","If the degree programme does not already request references, ESOP requires two professor referees and describes system invitations with a two-week response period. Follow the particular portal instructions and track receipt; do not assume an emailed promise is a submitted reference.",{"children":"If the degree programme does not already request references, ESOP requires two professor referees and describes system invitations with a two-week response period. Follow the particular portal instructions and track receipt; do not assume an emailed promise is a submitted reference."}]],["$","ol",null,{"className":"process-steps","aria-label":"Reference invitations and submission sequence","children":[["$","li","Check the master's prerequisites and whether ESOP eligibility applies to you.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":1}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Check the master's prerequisites and whether ESOP eligibility applies to you."}]]}],["$","li","Develop the pre-proposal from sources you have read and an achievable question.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":2}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Develop the pre-proposal from sources you have read and an achievable question."}]]}],["$","li","Confirm suitable referees and prepare the programme's admission documents.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":3}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Confirm suitable referees and prepare the programme's admission documents."}]]}],["$","li","Complete the ESOP part of eApply in the first window and inspect reference instructions.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":4}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Complete the ESOP part of eApply in the first window and inspect reference instructions."}]]}],["$","li","Submit early, save confirmation and monitor any interview or reference requests.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":5}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Submit early, save confirmation and monitor any interview or reference requests."}]]}]]}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://ethz.ch/students/en/studies/financial/scholarships/excellencescholarship.html",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://ethz.ch/students/en/studies/financial/scholarships/excellencescholarship.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"ETH reference instructions"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}]
2c:["$","section","4-A realistic research and funding plan",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"A realistic research and funding plan"}],[["$","p","Consider a fictional applicant interested in detecting errors in a small environmental dataset. A proposal to solve all climate prediction would overstate the available evidence. A narrower comparison of one baseline and one justified method, with a clear evaluation rule, is easier to assess and discuss.",{"children":"Consider a fictional applicant interested in detecting errors in a small environmental dataset. A proposal to solve all climate prediction would overstate the available evidence. A narrower comparison of one baseline and one justified method, with a clear evaluation rule, is easier to assess and discuss."}],["$","p","The same discipline applies to the budget. Keep the semester grant, tuition waiver, housing deposit and spending before the first payment in separate rows. Verify any dependants' costs or personal travel individually. A total scholarship headline should not become a promise that every optional expense is reimbursed.",{"children":"The same discipline applies to the budget. Keep the semester grant, tuition waiver, housing deposit and spending before the first payment in separate rows. Verify any dependants' costs or personal travel individually. A total scholarship headline should not become a promise that every optional expense is reimbursed."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","aside",null,{"className":"worked-example","children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Worked example"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Before finalising the pre-proposal, explain it aloud in two minutes: the question, the evidence, your method, the main limitation and the expected output. If you cannot explain how the method answers the question, revise the plan before polishing its wording."}]]}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
2d:["$","section","5-Final ESOP checklist",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Final ESOP checklist"}],[["$","p","The live eApply instructions are the authority for submission mechanics and closing time. Record the exact time you see instead of interpreting an ambiguous clock notation.",{"children":"The live eApply instructions are the authority for submission mechanics and closing time. Record the exact time you see instead of interpreting an ambiguous clock notation."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","$L2f",null,{"id":"scholarships/eth-zurich-esop:section-6","title":"Check your progress","items":["I meet the first-master's and academic-result conditions.","I checked the selected degree's own admission requirements.","My independently written pre-proposal follows the 500-word guidance.","Citations identify the prior work I actually used.","Referees understand their system submission instructions.","I verified the exact eApply closing time and saved confirmation.","My budget uses the autumn 2027 amount and accounts for payment timing."]}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]
2e:["$","section","6-Check the submission, then save the evidence",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-7","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Check the submission, then save the evidence"}],[["$","p","A saved draft and a submitted application are different states. Reopen the application summary, inspect every attachment and check the referee indicators. Keep the confirmation email or reference number with the version of the instructions you used. Put any later transcript, offer-acceptance or enrolment task in a separate calendar entry.",{"children":"A saved draft and a submitted application are different states. Reopen the application summary, inspect every attachment and check the referee indicators. Keep the confirmation email or reference number with the version of the instructions you used. Put any later transcript, offer-acceptance or enrolment task in a separate calendar entry."}],["$","p","The tracker is an editable planning sheet, not an application form or eligibility assessment. Its suggested next actions belong to you; deadlines and requirements remain controlled by the institution. Replace the blank owner, internal deadline and confirmation fields with your own plan.",{"children":"The tracker is an editable planning sheet, not an application form or eligibility assessment. Its suggested next actions belong to you; deadlines and requirements remain controlled by the institution. Replace the blank owner, internal deadline and confirmation fields with your own plan."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Check the submission, then save the evidence","children":[["$","a","/downloads/scholarship-application-tracker-2027.csv",{"href":"/downloads/scholarship-application-tracker-2027.csv","download":true,"children":["Download the scholarship application tracker (CSV)",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$8:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L5","/deadline-calendar/",{"href":"/deadline-calendar/","children":["Compare other scholarship deadlines",["$","$L6",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$8:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
